<!-- L07: vertices of a line closer than 0.01 m, one error per close pair.
     Two railways cut out of the 13997 Tokyo sample (v3) 53393690_rwy_6697_30_op.gml.
     rwy_27d8d580-aaf1-4969-86d9-52a7a0c898fa is unchanged and has no errors.
     rwy_5cf5a2d4-902a-4dfd-a97a-e3ab22c2e337 has two broken LOD0 lines, each one error:
     the first has a point added about 5 mm after its second vertex, and the second
     has a point added at the end about 5 mm west of its second vertex, a close pair
     that is not adjacent. Neither line crosses or touches itself. -->
